# Intentionally empty, and it has to exist — same reason as ../plugins/.gitkeep: the
# read-only mount replaces the image's provisioning tree, and a missing alerting/ directory
# makes Grafana log an error at every boot.
#
# Empty is also the correct content. This stack answers questions somebody is already asking;
# it does not page anybody, and ops/observability/prometheus/prometheus.yml has no rule files
# for the same reason. When there is an alert worth waking up for — the override rate on a
# step moving sharply would be the first candidate — it is provisioned here rather than
# clicked into the browser.
